### Smart Logistics API - Network Routes Testing
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

### ============================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS
### ============================================

### Root endpoint - API Welcome
GET http://localhost:3000/

###

### Network service health check
GET http://localhost:3000/network/health

###

### ============================================
### 2. GRAPH UPLOAD (Planned)
### ============================================

### Upload a graph with edges
POST http://localhost:3000/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "cost": 10 },
    { "from": "A", "to": "C", "cost": 5 },
    { "from": "B", "to": "D", "cost": 8 },
    { "from": "C", "to": "D", "cost": 12 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "E", "cost": 12 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "F", "cost": 4 },
    { "from": "F", "to": "G", "cost": 4 },
    { "from": "E", "to": "G", "cost": 9 },
    { "from": "C", "to": "H", "cost": 8 },
    { "from": "D", "to": "H", "cost": 4 },
    { "from": "F", "to": "H", "cost": 1 }
  ]
}

###

### ============================================
### 3. GET NODES FROM GRAPH (Planned)
### ============================================

### Get all nodes from a graph
GET http://localhost:3000/network/nodes/graph-id-1

###

### ============================================
### 4. ROUTE OPTIMIZATION (Planned)
### ============================================

### Calculate optimal route using Dijkstra's Algorithm
POST http://localhost:3000/route/optimize/graph-id-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originNodeId": "A",
  "destinationNodeId": "H"
}

###

### ============================================
### 5. INVALID REQUESTS - ERROR HANDLING
### ============================================

### Invalid graph - missing 'from' field
POST http://localhost:3000/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "to": "B", "cost": 10 }
  ]
}

###

### Invalid graph - negative cost
POST http://localhost:3000/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": [
    { "from": "A", "to": "B", "cost": -5 }
  ]
}

###

### Invalid graph - empty edges array
POST http://localhost:3000/network/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edges": []
}

###

### ============================================
### 6. DOCUMENTATION (Planned)
### ============================================

### Get Swagger API documentation
GET http://localhost:3000/docs

